    "created_at": "2026-04-10T15:58:54Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-04-10T15:58:54Z",
    "body": "After further testing, the failure sequence is:\n\n1. `devcontainer up` succeeds — the container starts and the bind mount is created.\n2. Zed calls `podman inspect <container_id>` to validate the workspace mount.\n3. Zed compares the mount `Source` returned by inspect against the\n   `--workspace-folder` path it originally passed.\n4. These never match because:\n   - Zed's workspace path (Windows): `C:/Users/umala/Documents/systemd-user-service-management-java`\n   - `podman inspect` Source (WSL2 POSIX): `/mnt/c/Users/umala/Documents/systemd-user-service-management-java`\n5. Zed concludes no mount exists and throws `ContainerNotValid`.",
